&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1em; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/181444/rss" title="github.com" style=" color: #3366aa;    font-size: 1.05em;"&gt;vue-superselect: A Headless Select/Combobox for Vue 3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
