&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📄 &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/181445/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500 !important;   "&gt;React PDF 10.4&lt;/a&gt; – Display PDFs in React apps. &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/181446/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500 !important;   "&gt;v10.4&lt;/a&gt; adds the ability to override colors used in rendering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
